# 4.1 Statistical association between one genotype and the phenotype
corTestResult = cor.test(phenotypes$Height, phenotypes$one_geno)    # Performs a correlation test between the 'Height' and 'one_geno' columns in the phenotypes data frame. Results stored in 'corTestResult'.
corTestResult$p.value                                               # Assessing the p-value from the correlation test result run above.

